SUMMARY:The C3 Growth Exchange
DESCRIPTION:Montclair Business Networking\nThe C3 Growth Exchange\nClarity
 \, Strategy & Momentum — In Every Session\n\nFeeling stuck\, stretched\,
  or unsure of your next best move? You’re not alone—and you don’t ha
 ve to figure it out on your own.\n\nThe C3 Growth Exchange is a free\, hig
 h-impact\, one-hour virtual session designed for founders and business lea
 ders who want real progress—not just ideas. Each session blends peer ins
 ight with expert facilitation to help you move from uncertainty to action.
 \n\nWhat to Expect:\n• Live\, supportive discussion with other growth-mi
 nded business owners\n• Practical guidance on your biggest challenges - 
 from strategy to execution\n• Fresh perspective and real-time problem so
 lving\n• Clear next steps you can implement immediately\n• Connection 
 with like-minded professionals\n\nCome with a challenge. Leave with clarit
 y and momentum.\n\\- When: 4th Tuesday of every month\n\\- Time: 12:00 –
  1:00 PM \\(ET\\)\n\\- Cost: Free\\\, Registration Required\\\, Limited Se
 ating
